    "detailed_description": "<h1>Get the Arcane Trigger Demo on Steam!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/711c94c56d2b066779065bebf0af6e63.avif?t=1745911263\" data-has-big /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/9f67bd5bb5930c4ef037e1f080de954b.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/9f67bd5bb5930c4ef037e1f080de954b.gif?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Devil's Castle! Endgame of Devil is a casual game that combines the gameplay of auto chess with a roguelike style. Utilize your wisdom and strategic skills to achieve victory, while also acknowledging the role of luck in your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5ef08492a0598cd02509393d7ff8a3d8.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5ef08492a0598cd02509393d7ff8a3d8.apng?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>Unlike other fantasy games where you strive to become a champion or hero, in Endgame of Devil, you embody the role of a devil! Facing the adventurers who keep coming for your treasure, you need to summon powerful minions and build a troop to shoo them away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b72751da9bf064e527ebfda48dc30b51.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b72751da9bf064e527ebfda48dc30b51.apng?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the adventurers within certain rounds, or the gems will be stolen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/ad3623e1405f5bee84fc306e2d12e695.avif?t=1745911263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b80544c3099507bc63097b88a06ebee6.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b80544c3099507bc63097b88a06ebee6.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b80544c3099507bc63097b88a06ebee6.mp4?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are 240 different minions that can be summoned now, and they will appear randomly before each battle begins. Choose your right-hand man according to the situation, build a strong lineup that supports each other, and defend yourself against the enemy's attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/284defc6317e2b92a47dd27fbe889207.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/284defc6317e2b92a47dd27fbe889207.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/06db349bb8c293ffe388c0af245167de.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/06db349bb8c293ffe388c0af245167de.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/bfc146a5f697625cdf464489341cc71f.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/bfc146a5f697625cdf464489341cc71f.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/12572fca2f6bbe1a5d6781f32e24ea6b.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/12572fca2f6bbe1a5d6781f32e24ea6b.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, there are 201 kinds of treasures, 19 legendary treasures, and 13 adventurer treasures you can have. Each round after you defeat the adventurers, you can choose an appropriate treasure to turn the tables! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5799fc0e479bafd0416e7eab9a23f938.avif?t=1745911263\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b41557a78fa7074ee139a2b4ec8872a4.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b41557a78fa7074ee139a2b4ec8872a4.gif?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>The game is beginner-friendly, but protecting your jewels can be challenging. Experiment with various lineups to overcome adventurers and complete the game! With its extensive content, this small game is perfect for leisurely play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5b17b705b6e57a11724e92a1b918fa18.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5b17b705b6e57a11724e92a1b918fa18.apng?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thanks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to all those who offered valuable advice or direct assistance during the game development process! (In no specific order): GaoDaRen (\u9ad8\u8fbe\u4eba), BanFan (\u62cc\u996d), MingHuang (\u8317\u51f0), HuaLaiShiYuRen (\u534e\u83b1\u58eb\u9c7c\u4eba), QiuYe (\u79cb\u591c), DaShui (\u5927\u7761), DaLian (\u5927\u8138), SiErNaNa (\u65af\u5c14\u5a1c\u5a1c), Faumi, blue, Obrean.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/9f67bd5bb5930c4ef037e1f080de954b.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/9f67bd5bb5930c4ef037e1f080de954b.gif?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Devil's Castle! Endgame of Devil is a casual game that combines the gameplay of auto chess with a roguelike style. Utilize your wisdom and strategic skills to achieve victory, while also acknowledging the role of luck in your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5ef08492a0598cd02509393d7ff8a3d8.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5ef08492a0598cd02509393d7ff8a3d8.apng?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>Unlike other fantasy games where you strive to become a champion or hero, in Endgame of Devil, you embody the role of a devil! Facing the adventurers who keep coming for your treasure, you need to summon powerful minions and build a troop to shoo them away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b72751da9bf064e527ebfda48dc30b51.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b72751da9bf064e527ebfda48dc30b51.apng?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the adventurers within certain rounds, or the gems will be stolen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/ad3623e1405f5bee84fc306e2d12e695.avif?t=1745911263\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b80544c3099507bc63097b88a06ebee6.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b80544c3099507bc63097b88a06ebee6.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b80544c3099507bc63097b88a06ebee6.mp4?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are 240 different minions that can be summoned now, and they will appear randomly before each battle begins. Choose your right-hand man according to the situation, build a strong lineup that supports each other, and defend yourself against the enemy's attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/284defc6317e2b92a47dd27fbe889207.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/284defc6317e2b92a47dd27fbe889207.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/06db349bb8c293ffe388c0af245167de.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/06db349bb8c293ffe388c0af245167de.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/bfc146a5f697625cdf464489341cc71f.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/bfc146a5f697625cdf464489341cc71f.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/12572fca2f6bbe1a5d6781f32e24ea6b.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/12572fca2f6bbe1a5d6781f32e24ea6b.webm?t=1745911263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, there are 201 kinds of treasures, 19 legendary treasures, and 13 adventurer treasures you can have. Each round after you defeat the adventurers, you can choose an appropriate treasure to turn the tables! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5799fc0e479bafd0416e7eab9a23f938.avif?t=1745911263\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b41557a78fa7074ee139a2b4ec8872a4.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/b41557a78fa7074ee139a2b4ec8872a4.gif?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>The game is beginner-friendly, but protecting your jewels can be challenging. Experiment with various lineups to overcome adventurers and complete the game! With its extensive content, this small game is perfect for leisurely play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5b17b705b6e57a11724e92a1b918fa18.poster.avif?t=1745911263\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343600/extras/5b17b705b6e57a11724e92a1b918fa18.apng?t=1745911263\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thanks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to all those who offered valuable advice or direct assistance during the game development process! (In no specific order): GaoDaRen (\u9ad8\u8fbe\u4eba), BanFan (\u62cc\u996d), MingHuang (\u8317\u51f0), HuaLaiShiYuRen (\u534e\u83b1\u58eb\u9c7c\u4eba), QiuYe (\u79cb\u591c), DaShui (\u5927\u7761), DaLian (\u5927\u8138), SiErNaNa (\u65af\u5c14\u5a1c\u5a1c), Faumi, blue, Obrean.</p>",
